WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.410
It is believed that teachers can exert a profound influence on their students’ academic pursuit and personal development.
人们认为，教师能够对学生的学业追求和个人发展产生深远的影响。

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:18.590
Beyond passing on knowledge, a good teacher can shape how students think, what they value and even which path they choose in life.
好老师除了传授知识，还能塑造学生的思维方式、价值取向，甚至影响他们人生道路的选择。

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:22.890
Academically, teachers act as guides who spark curiosity.
在学业上，教师是激发好奇心的引路人。

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:29.890
An inspiring lecture or a single word of encouragement may awaken a lifelong interest in a subject.
一堂鼓舞人心的讲座或一句鼓励的话，就可能唤起人对某门学科终身的兴趣。

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:43.730
My high school physics teacher, for example, often used simple experiments to explain difficult concepts, and it was in her class that I first dreamed of becoming an engineer, a dream I am still pursuing today.
比如，我的高中物理老师常常用简单的实验来讲解难懂的概念，正是在她的课上，我第一次萌生了当工程师的梦想，这个梦想我至今仍在追求。

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.650
In terms of personal development, teachers serve as role models.
在个人发展方面，教师是学生的榜样。

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:56.820
Their honesty, patience and sense of responsibility quietly teach students how to treat others and how to cope with difficulties.
他们的诚实、耐心和责任感，会潜移默化地教会学生如何待人、如何应对困难。

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:07.100
Given such influence, teachers should not only improve their teaching skills but also care about the growth of every student, especially those who are struggling.
鉴于这样的影响，教师不仅应该提高自己的教学技能，还应关心每一个学生的成长，尤其是那些学习吃力的学生。

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:16.200
Students, in turn, should make the most of every chance to ask questions and learn from their teachers, both inside and outside the classroom.
学生则应充分利用每一次机会提问、向老师学习，无论在课堂内外。

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.000
When teachers and students respect and inspire each other, education can truly fulfill its purpose.
当师生相互尊重、相互激励时，教育才能真正实现它的目的。
